{"kind":"stack","id":"s-circuits","title":"Switches and circuits","theme":{"background":"#fdf6e3","foreground":"#222222","font":"Arial, sans-serif"}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c1","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c1-term","content":"Circuit"},{"type":"text","id":"c1-def","content":"A closed loop that electricity can flow around, from the battery and back again."},{"type":"button","id":"c1-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c2"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c2","kind":"flash","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c2-term","content":"Switch"},{"type":"text","id":"c2-def","content":"A part that opens or closes a circuit. Closed lets electricity flow, open stops it."},{"type":"button","id":"c2-next","label":"Next Card","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c3"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c3","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"image","picto":"bulb"},{"type":"text","id":"c3-q","content":"When the switch is closed, what happens to the lamp?"},{"type":"button","id":"c3-a","label":"It lights up","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-b","label":"It goes dark","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c3-c","label":"It gets hot and breaks","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c4"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c4","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c4-q","content":"When the switch is open, does the lamp light?"},{"type":"button","id":"c4-a","label":"No, the circuit is broken","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-b","label":"Yes, it lights brightly","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c4-c","label":"Only if the battery is new","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c5"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c5","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c5-q","content":"Your circuit has a lamp, a battery and a switch. The lamp will not light. What do you do?"},{"type":"button","id":"c5-a","label":"Check the switch is closed","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c6"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c5-b","label":"Take the battery out and shake it","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c7"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c6","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c6-t","content":"You close the switch. The loop is complete and the lamp lights up. Well done."},{"type":"button","id":"c6-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c7","kind":"story","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c7-t","content":"Shaking the battery does nothing. The switch is still open, so the circuit is still broken."},{"type":"button","id":"c7-next","label":"Continue","actions":[{"type":"goto","cardId":"c8"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c8","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c8-q","content":"Why does a switch control whether the lamp lights?"},{"type":"button","id":"c8-a","label":"It opens and closes the circuit","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-b","label":"It stores electricity for later","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c8-c","label":"It makes the lamp warmer","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c9"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c9","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c9-q","content":"In a simple series circuit with a closed switch, how many paths can electricity take?"},{"type":"button","id":"c9-a","label":"One","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-b","label":"Two","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c9-c","label":"None","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c10"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c10","kind":"quiz","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c10-q","content":"You open the switch in a working circuit. What happens to the lamp?"},{"type":"button","id":"c10-a","label":"It goes out","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-b","label":"It gets brighter","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":0},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]},{"type":"button","id":"c10-c","label":"It turns a different colour","actions":[{"type":"score","delta":1},{"type":"goto","cardId":"c11"}]}],"actions":[]}}
{"kind":"card","card":{"id":"c11","kind":"end","elements":[{"type":"text","id":"c11-h","content":"You finished the switches and circuits set!"},{"type":"text","id":"c11-m","content":"Great work. Remember: a closed switch makes a complete loop, so the lamp lights. An open switch breaks the loop, so the lamp goes out."}],"actions":[]}}
